    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14350#discussion_r4040759808\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Could this be moved into <code>host_task_create</code>? To the extent that <code>set_thread</code> is a somewhat-hot function and I think that's the only caller which would otherwise trigger this, it might help keep this function a bit leaner to move it over there. That might mess up and/or require moving around some debug assertions though</p>\n</blockquote>",
