    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14350#discussion_r4040765949\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And, similarly, for handling <code>deferred_host_call_context</code> getting cleared above, could that move into the <code>first_poll</code> function or similar?</p>\n</blockquote>",
