    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> adamrk created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14350#discussion_r4063155227\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Now setting the value to <code>Some(CallContext::default)</code> only occurs in <code>host_task_create</code> and setting it to <code>None</code> occurs in <code>host_task_delete</code> and <code>materialize_host_task</code> (the two ways we switch out of a <code>DeferredHostTask</code> thread). We debug check the invariant on entry to <code>set_thread</code>, but not on exit because these fixups are done after calling <code>set_thread</code> in <code>host_task_{create, delete}</code>. But all three cases debug check the invariant themselves after switching the current thread.</p>\n</blockquote>",
